Small Update Update :)

 June 22th '98: Somehow, in my rush, I included the 
                wrong FileLock, FileHandle, and RastPort
                (which were the only updates) files in my
		last ASAP.lha upload about a week ago. The
                original ASAPUpd.lha did not include the
                RastPort.h, and the other header names
                weren't correct.

                I'm sending this along to avoid any problems
                and confusion. Very sorry, everyone! (I won't
                rush my next upload, I promise :)
